SUMMARY:V for Volleyball Beach July11th 1pm-8pm at Sandy Hook Beach LotB
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nI'm Mike 
 and my son is Mikey/Michael.\nFree to play. We'll 1 Wilson ball & another 
 player will bring his beach ball. Bring a ball?\nwe have a Volleyball NET!
 f you have fun and would like to play with us at other locations\, join us
 !\n[V for Volleyball New Jersey | Facebook](https://www.facebook.com/group
 s/1587314685975434)\n[Lot B - Google Maps](https://www.google.com/maps/pla
 ce/Lot+B\,+Hartshorne+Dr\,+Sandy+Hook\,+NJ+07732/@40.4068775\,-73.9806326\
 ,845m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m6!3m5!1s0x89c23979e6438107:0x5ae193dcaed3a79c!8m2!3d
 40.407021!4d-73.9782738!16s%2Fg%2F11bvtfc557?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDUyNi
 4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D)
