X-SOURCE:Meetup: NJ Bowling, Volleyball, Tennis & More
UID:event_315569289@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260708T031801Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260711T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260711T213000
SUMMARY:Active Singles Social: Pickleball\, World Cup Watch Party - Meet N
 ew People
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nLooking f
 or a fun way to meet new people in New Jersey?\n\nJoin us for a high-energ
 y Singles Social featuring beginner-friendly pickleball\, Bachata lessons\
 , Latin music\, dancing\, world cup watch party and a chance to meet 100+ 
 active singles from across NJ and the NYC area. We rented out the whole in
 door facility.\n\nExpect a packed\, lively night.\nWhether you're looking 
 for friendship\, dating\, new connections\, or just a fun night out — th
 is event helps people connect naturally in a relaxed\, no-pressure setting
 .\n\nWe will also have a watch party for the FIFA quarterfinals\n\n🎁 GI
 VEAWAYS ALL NIGHT\n🏆 Win a Luzz Inferno Frozen Pro Pickleball Paddle (2
 60 value)\n🎁 10+ gift baskets raffled throughout the evening\n🎁 Surp
 rise prizes + giveaways\n🎵 LATIN NIGHT VIBES+ TWO LIVE DJs\nReggaeton 
 • Salsa • Bachata • Latin Hits & Party Favorites all night long.\n
 💃 BACHATA LESSONS\nBeginner-friendly Bachata taught by DJ Jda Bachata a
 nd DJ Carliita of Bachata Heaven. No experience needed.\n🏓 BEGINNER-FRI
 ENDLY PICKLEBALL\nNever played before? No problem — about 70% of our att
 endees are beginners. We'll have beginner courts and guidance to help you 
 learn and have fun.\n❤️ MEET SINGLES NATURALLY\nThis is NOT speed dati
 ng. No forced intros\, no awkward icebreakers\, no pressure.\nYou'll meet 
 people naturally while playing\, dancing\, laughing\, and hanging out.\n
 🙋 NOT INTO PICKLEBALL? NO PROBLEM\nCome to dance\, socialize\, enjoy th
 e music\, or just hang with friends. Zero pressure to play.\n👋 COMING S
 OLO?\nMost attendees do. Bring good vibes — we'll take care of the rest.
 \n📅 Saturday\, July 11\, 2026\n⏰ 6:00 PM – 9:30 PM\n📍 Pickleball
  Kingdom Watchung — 1511 Rt 22\, Watchung\, NJ\n💵 20 early bird throu
 gh 6/30\nPrices increase Wed\, 7/8\n🎟️ TICKETS: [www.pbdates.org](htt
 ps://www.pbdates.org/)\n(Tap "Attend" here to save your spot — purchase 
 your ticket at pbdates.org to confirm entry.)\n\n⚠️ FINE PRINT\nBy att
 ending\, you acknowledge:\n\\- No Liability — Neither Thryve\\\, NJ Sing
 les\\\, nor any organizers are liable for any harm or loss incurred during
  the event\\.\n\\- Photos & Video — Photos/video may be taken for market
 ing\\. Let an organizer know if you'd rather not appear\\.\n\\- Email Upda
 tes — RSVPing adds you to the Yes We Thryve / NJ Singles list\\. Unsubsc
 ribe anytime\\.\n\\- Be Kind — Respect staff\\\, venue\\\, and fellow gu
 ests\\.\n\\- Come & Go Freely — Casual\\\, no\\-pressure event\\.\n\\- A
 ll sales final\\. No refunds\\. Non\\-transferable\\.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/315569289/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260706T113446Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260706T113446Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
